# Environment variables are per-app, not shared at the root:
#   backend/.env.example  - FastAPI backend (anon key only, no privileged credential)
#   frontend/.env.example - Next.js frontend (anon key only; NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars are
#                           client-exposed by design)
#
# Copy each to backend/.env and frontend/.env respectively and fill in your
# own Supabase project's URL and anon key. Never commit the filled-in files.
#
# AI-provider and market-data variables will be added to backend/.env.example
# when those milestones (Weeks 5-6 and 3-4 respectively) actually add code
# that reads them - not before, so this file never documents a variable
# nothing in the codebase uses yet.
